 "number": 295,
 "legislation_type": "GEN",
 "caption": "State Board of Education; local school systems to maintain and publish a registry of all contracts worth more than $10,000.00; require",
 "summary": "A BILL to be entitled an Act to amend Part 8 of Article 6 of Chapter 2 of Title 20 of the Official Code of Georgia Annotated, relating to State Board of Education under the \"Quality Basic Education Act,\" so as to require local school systems to maintain and publish a registry of all contracts worth more than $10,000.00 involving the use of any state funds; to provide for such information to be included on the contract registry; to require local boards of education to adopt policies; to provide for enforcement; to prohibit waivers; to provide for related matters; to repeal conflicting laws; and for other purposes.",
